  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building resilience and supporting solutions to displacement in Central Darfur - Building resilience and working towards durable solutions in Darfur</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r resiliens och l&#xf6;sningar f&#xf6;r internflyktingar i Central Darfur</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reduction of vulnerabilities due to displacement for IDPs in Golo, Nertiti and Um Dukhun localities in Central Darfur, improving resilience and paving the way for durable solutions</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen v&#xe4;nder sig till m&#xe4;nniskor
p&#xe5; flykt och deras v&#xe4;rdsamh&#xe4;llen i delstaten Central Darfur, f&#xf6;r att st&#xf6;dja deras
motst&#xe5;ndskraft, skydd, lokalt fredsbyggande, samt l&#xe4;gga grunden f&#xf6;r mer h&#xe5;llbara
l&#xf6;sningar. Projektet genomf&#xf6;rs av ett konsortium med R&#xe4;dda Barnen, MercyCorps, samt DRC som ledande organisation.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This addresses displaced people&apos;s needs along with those of the host communities in Central
Darfur, to support their resilience, protection, local peacebuilding and early
solutions to displacement. It is carried out by a consortium with Save the Children, MercyCorps, and DRC as the lead organisation.</narrative>
  </description>
